### Requests for IntelliJ's HTTP client (or VS Code's REST Client). Start the app first: ./gradlew bootRun
@host = http://localhost:8085

### Upcoming events (the ones that have not started yet)
GET {{host}}/events

### Search: city (whole name, any case), part of the name, a start-time range — every filter optional
GET {{host}}/events?city=cluj-napoca&name=react&from=2027-01-01T00:00:00&to=2027-03-01T00:00:00

### Also events that already started: give a "from" in the past
GET {{host}}/events?from=2020-01-01T00:00:00

### The most booked events
GET {{host}}/events/top?limit=2

### One event
GET {{host}}/events/react-cluj

### Unknown event: 404 application/problem+json
GET {{host}}/events/nope

### Create an event: 201 with a Location header
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Kubernetes Basics", "venueName": "Cowork Timisoara", "city": "Timisoara", "startsAt": "2027-05-12T18:00:00", "capacity": 25}

### Invalid event: 400, the office is never called
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "venueName": "Nowhere", "city": "Cluj-Napoca", "startsAt": "2020-01-01T10:00:00", "capacity": 0}
